<div class="divider"><span class="dot"></span></div>

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="kicker" data-i18n="about.kicker">Why Europe through Portugal</span>
      <h2 data-i18n="about.h2">Your gateway to 500M+ European followers &amp; brands.</h2>
      <p data-i18n="about.p">Portugal offers an ideal launchpad for Asian content creators looking to internationalize. With digital nomad &amp; creator-friendly residency options, low friction, and full EU market access, you can turn your digital footprint into a global media brand.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="facts">
      <div class="fact">
        <div class="num">500M</div>
        <div class="label" data-i18n="fact1.label">European consumer market reach and brand collaborations</div>
      </div>
      <div class="fact">
        <div class="num">EU</div>
        <div class="label" data-i18n="fact2.label">Legal residency, freedom to travel and film across Schengen</div>
      </div>
      <div class="fact">
        <div class="num">100%</div>
        <div class="label" data-i18n="fact3.label">Bilingual management &amp; localized monetization support</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider"><span class="dot"></span></div>

<section id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="kicker" data-i18n="services.kicker">Creator Programs</span>
      <h2 data-i18n="services.h2">Three paths to European growth.</h2>
      <p data-i18n="services.p">Whether you want to launch brand deals in Europe, set up your creator media company, or secure long-term EU residency, we handle the infrastructure.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="journey">
      <div class="journey-item">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <div>
          <h3 data-i18n="package1.title">Brand Expansion &amp; Sponsorships</h3>
          <p class="tagline" data-i18n="package1.tagline">Test the European market with high-impact brand collaborations and localized campaigns.</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-i18n="package1.li1">Introduction to top European brands &amp; agencies</li>
            <li data-i18n="package1.li2">Cross-cultural campaign strategy &amp; localization</li>
            <li data-i18n="package1.li3">Contract negotiation and legal protection</li>
            <li data-i18n="package1.li4">Audience growth analytics in Western markets</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="journey-item">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <div>
          <h3 data-i18n="package2.title">Media Company Setup &amp; Visa</h3>
          <p class="tagline" data-i18n="package2.tagline">Establish your official European production entity and secure your legal residency.</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-i18n="package2.li1">Full company incorporation in Portugal</li>
            <li data-i18n="package2.li2">D2 Entrepreneur or Digital Nomad Visa preparation</li>
            <li data-i18n="package2.li3">Tax structure optimization with licensed accountants</li>
            <li data-i18n="package2.li4">Full legal paperwork handled by partner immigration lawyers</li>
            <li data-i18n="package2.li5">End-to-end guidance until visa approval</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="journey-item">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <div>
          <h3 data-i18n="package3.title">Full Management &amp; Studio Support</h3>
          <p class="tagline" data-i18n="package3.tagline">Long-term partnership to scale your content, productions, and revenue in Europe.</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-i18n="package3.li1">Dedicated manager for daily European operations</li>
            <li data-i18n="package3.li2">Production coordination &amp; local filming support in Lisbon</li>
            <li data-i18n="package3.li3">Accounting coordination and compliant monetization</li>
            <li data-i18n="package3.li4">Residency renewal &amp; family reunification support</li>
            <li data-i18n="package3.li5">Exclusive networking events with European creators</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider"><span class="dot"></span></div>

<section id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="kicker" data-i18n="process.kicker">How it works</span>
      <h2 data-i18n="process.h2">From Asian digital star to European icon.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="process-grid">
      <div class="p-item">
        <div class="num">1</div>
        <p><strong data-i18n="p1.title">Talent Audit.</strong> <span data-i18n="p1.text">We review your current channels, content style, and expansion goals.</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-item">
        <div class="num">2</div>
        <p><strong data-i18n="p2.title">Strategy &amp; Setup.</strong> <span data-i18n="p2.text">We pitch brand opportunities or draft your legal roadmap to EU residency.</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-item">
        <div class="num">3</div>
        <p><strong data-i18n="p3.title">Scale in Europe.</strong> <span data-i18n="p3.text">Launch campaigns, produce content locally, and grow your European fame.</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider"><span class="dot"></span></div>

<section id="about-team">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="kicker" data-i18n="team.kicker">Who's behind this</span>
      <h2 data-i18n="team.h2">Cross-border experts for digital creators.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-box">
      <p data-i18n="team.text">Okaerinasai Creators connects Asian online talent with European opportunities. Backed by licensed legal and tax partners in Lisbon and digital media specialists in Japan, we bridge the gap between Asian social ecosystems and the European market safely and professionally.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider"><span class="dot"></span></div>

<section id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="kicker" data-i18n="faq.kicker">Questions</span>
      <h2 data-i18n="faq.h2">Everything creators ask before expanding.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3 data-i18n="faq1.q">Do I need a massive follower count to apply?</h3>
      <p data-i18n="faq1.a">Not necessarily. While high follower counts help, we also look for highly engaged niche creators, streamers, and digital entrepreneurs who have unique content ready for European audiences.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3 data-i18n="faq2.q">Can I move to Europe while keeping my audience in Asia?</h3>
      <p data-i18n="faq2.a">Yes! Many creators live in Portugal part-time or full-time while producing content for global platforms or scaling cross-border brand partnerships between Asia and Europe.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3 data-i18n="faq3.q">How do brand deals and earnings get handled legally?</h3>
      <p data-i18n="faq3.a">We help you structure your corporate setup and work with our licensed accounting partners to ensure all European revenues and taxes are handled properly and compliantly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3 data-i18n="faq4.q">Do you assist with visa applications for creators?</h3>
      <p data-i18n="faq4.a">Yes. Through our partner immigration lawyers, we assist creators and digital nomads with the correct residency permits (such as D2 or Digital Nomad visas) to live legally in Portugal.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
